# Pinned versions and checksums of every competitor and toolchain (plan §6.2, hard rule 4).
# Downloads are verified against these before use; apt packages are verified by apt's signed
# indexes and their exact installed version is recorded in each run's machine.txt.
# Checksums were taken from the projects' own checksum files or GitHub's release asset digests
# on 2026-11-07.

